(7, 4, 4, 'Web Development Workshop', 'web-development-workshop', 'Build and deploy a full-stack web app in one day with HTML, CSS, JavaScript and PHP.', 'A practical, laptop-open workshop for beginners and junior developers. You\'ll go from an empty folder to a deployed full-stack app by the end of the day.

