Bring your laptop. Lunch and coffee are included. Seats are limited to keep the group small.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80', 'LearnLab Campus', 'Rr. Garibaldi 7, Prishtina', 'Prishtina', 'Kosovo', 42.6553, 21.1641, TIMESTAMP(DATE_ADD(CURDATE(), INTERVAL 6 DAY), '10:00:00'), TIMESTAMP(DATE_ADD(CURDATE(), INTERVAL 6 DAY), '16:00:00'), 'published', 0, 4922, NOW() - INTERVAL 64200 MINUTE, NULL, NOW() - INTERVAL 64800 MINUTE),
(8, 4, 4, 'AI & Future Technologies', 'ai-future-technologies', 'A hands-on afternoon on large language models, AI agents and what they mean for your work.', 'Artificial intelligence is changing how we build products and run businesses. This session cuts through the hype with live demos and practical exercises.

Agenda:
