Suitable for developers, product managers and curious professionals.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677442136019-21780ecad995?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80', 'Innovation Centre Kosovo', 'Rr. Rexhep Mala 28A, Prishtina', 'Prishtina', 'Kosovo', 42.668, 21.164, TIMESTAMP(DATE_ADD(CURDATE(), INTERVAL 12 DAY), '13:00:00'), TIMESTAMP(DATE_ADD(CURDATE(), INTERVAL 12 DAY), '18:00:00'), 'published', 1, 3524, NOW() - INTERVAL 64200 MINUTE, NULL, NOW() - INTERVAL 64800 MINUTE),
(9, 4, 4, 'Digital Marketing Masterclass', 'digital-marketing-masterclass', 'Strategy, content, paid ads and analytics — a masterclass for marketers and founders.', 'A five-hour masterclass covering the full digital marketing funnel, with real campaign case studies from regional brands.

